# Text-rewrite sites over generated Loom admitted as inherited debt (kit/loom_rewrites.py; HRX-like 11-25).
# This file may only shrink: `python3 kit/loom_rewrites.py shrink` drops rows whose site is gone; nothing adds one.
# A new site needs '# loom-builtin: <feature> ruled out: <reason> (<path>:<line> at vX.Y.Z)' above its def.
# columns: file, function, kind, anchor (AST hash), excerpt (not compared)
